  <section class="v6-sec v6-w rv-in" aria-labelledby="hmco"><div class="v6-hd"><h2 id="hmco" class="v6-h">Built by a nurse.</h2><a class="v6-a" href="/about">Our story ›</a></div>
   <div class="hm-co-g v6-co">
    <div class="hm-fdr"><div class="hm-av" aria-hidden="true">TS</div><div><h3>Tyler Savage, RN, CRS, LNC</h3><p class="hm-k">Founder</p><p class="hm-dz"><b><span aria-hidden="true">✿</span> DAISY Award nominee</b> <small>Nominated by a patient</small></p><p>A registered nurse with more than a decade at the bedside in medical-surgical, step-down, long-term acute care and rehabilitation units in Georgia and Tennessee. Charge nurse, house supervisor, preceptor and safety officer, on code and rapid response teams. He has charted in Epic, Cerner (Oracle Health), MEDITECH and ProTouch, and holds ACLS, BLS and NIH Stroke Scale certifications.</p></div></div>
    <dl class="hm-facts">
     <div><dt>Company</dt><dd>Vexcura LLC, a Georgia limited liability company</dd></div>
     <div><dt>Headquarters</dt><dd>27 General Cleburne St.<br>Ringgold, GA 30736</dd></div>
     <div><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+17626772802">(762) 677-2802</a></dd></div>
    </dl>
   </div>
   <ul class="v6-chips v6-tech"><li>Cloudflare global network</li><li>Encrypted connections</li><li>Hospital-style audit trail</li><li>Run from Ringgold, GA, on Starlink</li></ul>
