  <section class="v6-sec v6-w rv-in" aria-labelledby="hmn"><div class="v6-hd"><h2 id="hmn" class="v6-h">What's new.</h2></div>
   <div class="v6-rw"><div class="v6-row v6-news" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="What's new, swipe for more"><article class="hm-news"><p class="hm-k"><time>November 2026</time></p><h3><a href="/for-nursing-students">Every nursing student can use Vexcura free</a></h3><p>Sign up with a name, email and password. The full practice exam, the academic EHR, simulations and the study tools come with the account, with or without a school.</p><a class="arw" href="/for-nursing-students">Learn more<span aria-hidden="true"> &rarr;</span></a></article><article class="hm-news"><p class="hm-k"><time>November 2026</time></p><h3><a href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students">Print the complete chart</a></h3><p>Students and instructors can print or download a patient's whole chart, from admission to the latest entry, for programs that grade on paper.</p><a class="arw" href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students">Learn more<span aria-hidden="true"> &rarr;</span></a></article><article class="hm-news"><p class="hm-k"><time>November 2026</time></p><h3><a href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students">Photos in the chart, with identifying details removed</a></h3><p>A media activity lets students add practice photos to the chart. Location data is stripped, and a redaction tool lets students cover anything identifying.</p><a class="arw" href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students">Learn more<span aria-hidden="true"> &rarr;</span></a></article></div><div class="v6-arr" aria-hidden="true"><button type="button" class="v6-prev" tabindex="-1">‹</button><button type="button" class="v6-next" tabindex="-1">›</button></div></div></section>
